    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 51,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 4,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 51,
            "column": 6
          },
          "text": "Q: How do I buy credits?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 52,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 52,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "A: On the Credits page, select the amount you want to purchase (or use the dropdown for custom amounts), then click "
        },
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "location": {
            "line": 52,
            "column": 117
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 52,
                "column": 119
              },
              "text": "Buy credits"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 52,
            "column": 132
          },
          "text": ". You'll be redirected to Stripe checkout where you can adjust the quantity and complete payment."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 54,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 4,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 54,
            "column": 6
          },
          "text": "Q: When are credits used?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 55,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 55,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "A: Credits are automatically consumed when you exceed your plan limits for monthly active users, storage, or bandwidth. They provide a flexible way to handle overages without service interruption"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 57,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 4,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 57,
            "column": 6
          },
          "text": "Q: Are payments secure?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 58,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 58,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "A: Yes, payments are fully managed by stripe. Capgo never gets access to your credit card details. Stripe takes security very seriously. "
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "location": {
            "line": 58,
            "column": 138
          },
          "url": "https://stripe.com/docs/security/",
          "title": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 58,
                "column": 139
              },
              "text": "Learn more about stripe security policy"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 60,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 4,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 60,
            "column": 6
          },
          "text": "Q: Will capgo automatically upgrade my plan when I exceed the limit?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 61,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 61,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "A: No, capgo will never change your plan."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 63,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 4,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 63,
            "column": 6
          },
          "text": "Q: Will cagpo send me an email when my plan is near its limits?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 64,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 64,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "A: Yes, capgo will send you an email informing you about the usage."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 66,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 4,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 66,
            "column": 6
          },
          "text": "Q: Will the plan I purchase affect the organizations I am invited to?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 67,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 67,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "A: No, the plan will only affect the organization you have currently selected.\nPlease refer to "
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "location": {
            "line": 68,
            "column": 17
          },
          "url": "/docs/webapp/organization-system/#billing",
          "title": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 68,
                "column": 18
              },
              "text": "the organization documentation"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 68,
            "column": 92
          },
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
